Third-party software
--------------------
Wren embeds the Servo web engine (https://servo.org), licensed under
MPL-2.0. Servo, Stylo, WebRender and SpiderMonkey keep their MPL-2.0
headers, like Wren's own MPL-2.0 files.

Wren's user interface is built on GPUI-CE (https://github.com/gpui-ce/gpui-ce),
a community fork of the GPUI framework, licensed under Apache-2.0.

Tooling and scripts copied from the owner's template are licensed under
MPL-2.0 (relicensed by their author for Wren).

The full list of third-party crates and their licences is generated with
`cargo about` and shipped with each release. Until then, run `cargo deny list`
to see the licences in the dependency tree.
